; getline_negative_index: the other half of the same bound.
;
; The two halves are reached by different code on the Rust VM -- the usize
; conversion rejects this one and the extent comparison rejects
; getline_index_out_of_range's -- so both are pinned. They must report the
; same identity, and both must report the raw operand rather than whatever
; the conversion produced.
;
; xqvm_py returned 0 here too: a dict lookup on a negative key simply misses.

PUSH 4
BQMX r0

PUSH -1
GETLINE r0
HALT
